ead"},{"start":178.583,"end":180.123,"text":"The Way, The Life and Truth"},{"start":180.743,"end":182.373,"text":"May we temptation conquer"},{"start":182.993,"end":184.496,"text":"Unto victory we plead.ST BARNABBAS"}],"start":167.389,"end":184.496},{"key":"11","lines":[{"start":186.266,"end":187.911,"text":"Thou we praise for Barnabbas"},{"start":188.531,"end":189.863,"text":"Who in love forsaken"},{"start":190.483,"end":192.278,"text":"Worldly pleasures and treasures"},{"start":192.898,"end":194.345,"text":"The sublime he thus seek"},{"start":194.965,"end":196.662,"text":"While the mundane earth groweth"},{"start":197.282,"end":198.834,"text":"Descend on us Thine spirit"},{"start":199.454,"end":201.434,"text":"We plead Lord, may Thine comfort"},{"start":202.054,"end":203.613,"text":"The whole world overwhelm.ST JOHN THE BAPTIST"}],"start":186.266,"end":203.613},{"key":"12","lines":[{"start":205.383,"end":207.087,"text":"Thou we praise for the Baptist"},{"start":207.707,"end":209.068,"text":"Fore-runner of the lord"},{"start":209.688,"end":211.034,"text":"Elijah for real is he"},{"start":211.654,"end":213.251,"text":"Making Jesus way plain"},{"start":213.871,"end":215.456,"text":"Greatest prophet we hail thee"},{"start":216.076,"end":217.644,"text":"His blessed morning witness"},{"start":218.264,"end":219.651,"text":"Make us blessed we plead"},{"start":220.271,"end":221.832,"text":"Thee As for Thine day we hope.ST PETER"}],"start":205.383,"end":221.832},{"key":"13","lines":[{"start":223.602,"end":225.222,"text":"Thou we praise for Saint Peter"},{"start":225.842,"end":227.29,"text":"Of them all he's so brave"},{"start":227.91,"end":229.316,"text":"But in trial denied Him"},{"start":229.936,"end":231.396,"text":"Thrice in remorse he went"},{"start":232.016,"end":233.632,"text":"In fellowship with the priests"},{"start":234.252,"end":235.919,"text":"To nuture the flock of Christ"},{"start":236.539,"end":238.174,"text":"Words of courage he giveth"},{"start":238.794,"end":240.216,"text":"And thus growing in zeal.ST JAMES"}],"start":223.602,"end":240.216},{"key":"14","lines":[{"start":241.986,"end":243.603,"text":"Thou we praise for Thy servant"},{"start":244.223,"end":245.616,"text":"Who's slain of King Herod"},{"start":246.236,"end":247.819,"text":"The cup of His sufferings drank"},{"start":248.439,"end":249.886,"text":"His words He fulfilleth"},{"start":250.506,"end":252.073,"text":"Let us never in haste be"},{"start":252.693,"end":254.136,"text":"But patiently waiting still"},{"start":254.756,"end":256.397,"text":"Rejoicing in all sufferings"},{"start":257.017,"end":258.341,"text":"If Thou beckon on us.ST BARTHLOMEUS"}],"start":241.986,"end":258.341},{"key":"15","lines":[{"start":260.111,"end":261.774,"text":"Thou we praise for Barthlomeu"},{"start":262.394,"end":263.689,"text":"The sincere disciple"},{"start":264.309,"end":265.968,"text":"Who Jesus glory beheld"},{"start":266.588,"end":267.915,"text":"Beneath the tree of fig"},{"start":268.535,"end":270.33,"text":"Lord make us sincere we plead"},{"start":270.95,"end":272.55,"text":"Christian bonafide truly"},{"start":273.17,"end":274.781,"text":"We plead Thee come dwell with us"},{"start":275.401,"end":276.878,"text":"And feed our fainting soul.ST MATTHEW"}],"start":260.111,"end":276.878},{"key":"16","lines":[{"start":278.648,"end":280.348,"text":"Thou we praise for Saint Matthew"},{"start":280.968,"end":282.516,"text":"Who of Thine birth fore-told"},{"start":283.136,"end":284.783,"text":"Worldly treasures forsaken"},{"start":285.403,"end":286.915,"text":"The path of life he chose"},{"start":287.535,"end":289.355,"text":"We plead, our soul deliver"},{"start":289.975,"end":291.649,"text":"From all earthly desires"},{"start":292.269,"end":293.805,"text":"To Thine call may we harken"},{"start":294.425,"end":295.892,"text":"Let's rise and follow Thee.ST LUKE"}],"start":278.648,"end":295.892},{"key":"17","lines":[{"start":297.662,"end":299.222,"text":"Thou we praise for physician"},{"start":299.842,"end":301.222,"text":"For the gospel he brought"},{"start":301.842,"end":303.259,"text":"Reveal Thee as Physician"},{"start":303.879,"end":305.264,"text":"Co-bearer of our pains"},{"start":305.884,"end":307.283,"text":"Anoint us for Thine healing"},{"start":307.903,"end":309.762,"text":"Unto us all our souls Minister"},{"start":310.382,"end":311.633,"text":"Thine priceless balm"},{"start":312.253,"end":313.852,"text":"Unto us, all our lives.ST SIMON & JUDAS"}],"start":297.662,"end":313.852},{"key":"18","lines":[{"start":315.622,"end":317.235,"text":"Unto Thine saint disciples"},{"start":317.855,"end":319.374,"text":"We praise Thee oh our Lord"},{"start":319.994,"end":321.749,"text":"By Love their souls inspired"},{"start":322.369,"end":323.917,"text":"Sacred path all to trod"},{"start":324.537,"end":326.087,"text":"May we thus be inspired"},{"start":326.707,"end":328.181,"text":"The Lord Jesus exalt"},{"start":328.801,"end":330.238,"text":"May we in love united"},{"start":330.858,"end":333.311,"text":"Abode of rest to dwell.GENERAL ENDING"}],"start":315.622,"end":333.311},{"key":"19","lines":[{"start":335.081,"end":336.76,"text":"Apostle, Prophet, Martyr"},{"start":337.38,"end":338.763,"text":"The Holy band divine"},{"start":339.383,"end":341.09,"text":"Rending their hymns ceaselessly"},{"start":341.71,"end":343.326,"text":"Decked in robes white as snow"},{"start":343.946,"end":345.447,"text":"For all the saints departed"},{"start":346.067,"end":347.901,"text":"We praise Thee oh Lord our God"},{"start":348.521,"end":350.335,"text":"Their footsteps towing, troding"},{"start":350.955,"end":352.279,"text":"Worshipping Thee alone."}],"start":335.081,"end":352.279},{"key":"20","lines":[{"start":354.049,"end":355.576,"text":"Praises to Father above"},{"start":356.196,"end":357.597,"text":"And unto God the son"},{"start":358.217,"end":359.634,"text":"Also to Holy Spirit"},{"start":360.254,"end":361.616,"text":"Sacred Trinity God"},{"start":362.236,"end":3